00:57.724 --> 00:59.893
and secret headquarters
of Mermaid Man
和秘密总部
人鱼男的

00:59.976 --> 01:03.062
master of maritime justice
and defender of Bikini Bottom.
海事司法硕士
和比基尼底部的防守者。

01:03.146 --> 01:05.190
Semi-retired.
半退休状态。

01:05.273 --> 01:07.817
And his faithful ward
Barnacle Boy.
还有他忠实的监护人
藤壶男孩。

01:07.901 --> 01:09.486
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

01:09.569 --> 01:11.738
Today we find this
duo of dynamism
今天我们发现这个
活力二重奏

01:11.821 --> 01:15.116
engaged in their favorite
pastime: watching TV.
从事自己喜欢的事
消遣：看电视。

01:19.120 --> 01:21.247
But wait, what's this?
但是等等，这是什么？

01:21.331 --> 01:24.125
Why, it's Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy's biggest fans
为什么，这是美人鱼男
和藤壶男孩的最大粉丝

01:24.209 --> 01:26.377
SpongeBob SquarePants
and Patrick Star.
海绵宝宝
和帕特里克星。

01:26.461 --> 01:28.046
Don't they look peaceful?
他们看起来不是很平静吗？

01:28.129 --> 01:29.339
Yeah.
是的。

01:29.422 --> 01:31.090
Wake up!
醒醒吧！

01:33.843 --> 01:35.470
I'll deal with
these super-villains
我会处理
这些超级恶棍

01:35.553 --> 01:38.598
with my trusty Mermarang!
和我值得信赖的美宝鱼一起！

01:38.681 --> 01:41.935
Hey, those aren't
super-villains.
嘿，那些不是
超级恶棍。

01:42.018 --> 01:44.771
Hi, Mermaid- Ow.
嗨，美人鱼——噢。

01:44.854 --> 01:49.192
I can't believe Mermaid Man
hit me with his Mermarang.
我不敢相信美人鱼男
用他的人鱼镖攻击我。

01:49.275 --> 01:50.819
It's so awesome.
太棒了。

01:50.902 --> 01:51.945
Wow.
哇。

01:52.028 --> 01:53.363
Can you beat me up next?
接下来你能打败我吗？

01:53.446 --> 01:55.490
Keep on your guard,
Barnacle Boy.
保持警惕，
藤壶男孩。

01:55.573 --> 01:57.242
They're getting ready
for another attack.
他们正在准备
进行另一次攻击。

01:57.325 --> 01:59.994
Those aren't super-villains.
那些不是超级恶棍。

02:00.078 --> 02:03.122
It's just that kid,
uh, SpongeBob,
and his goofy friend.
只是那个孩子，
呃，海绵宝宝，
和他的傻朋友。

02:03.206 --> 02:05.500
Hey, kid, can you give us
our Mermarang back?
嘿，孩子，你能给我们吗？
我们的人鱼鱼回来了？

02:05.583 --> 02:06.876
We only got the one.
我们只得到了一个。

02:06.960 --> 02:07.794
Hey, sure thing.
嘿，当然可以。

02:07.877 --> 02:09.462
Oh, don't throw-
哦，别扔——

02:10.547 --> 02:12.006
Hey, it came back.
嘿嘿，它回来了。

02:12.090 --> 02:13.424
Yeah,  ,
it does that.
是的，，
它就是这样做的。

02:13.508 --> 02:14.384
I'll try again.
我会再试一次。

02:14.467 --> 02:17.554
No-
不-

02:17.637 --> 02:20.098
Look, I'll just
come and get-
你看，我就
来吧-

02:20.181 --> 02:22.141
What is wrong with you?
你怎么了？

02:22.225 --> 02:23.810
Nice shot.
好球。

02:23.893 --> 02:26.396
Wow, that Mermarang
really likes you.
哇，那个美宝鱼
真的很喜欢你。

02:26.479 --> 02:27.939
I know.
我知道。

02:28.022 --> 02:30.149
Now just hand me
the Mermarang, son-
现在只要递给我
人鱼鱼，儿子——

02:30.233 --> 02:32.610
I've got it!
我明白了！

02:32.694 --> 02:35.446
Runaway Mermarang!
逃跑的人鱼鱼！

02:58.261 --> 02:59.304
Ow.
噢。

03:05.143 --> 03:06.144
SpongeBob: Hi.
海绵宝宝：嗨。

03:06.227 --> 03:09.022
How you feeling?
你感觉怎么样？

03:09.105 --> 03:11.900
Would you get off of me?
你愿意从我身上下来吗？

03:11.983 --> 03:13.526
Ok.
好的。

03:13.610 --> 03:15.737
What are you two
doing here, anyway?
你们两个是什么
无论如何，在这里做什么？

03:15.820 --> 03:19.032
Oh, I almost forgot.
哦，我差点忘了。

03:19.115 --> 03:20.658
I brought you flowers.
我给你带来了花。

03:20.742 --> 03:23.202
Since you two
are feeling so poorly.
自从你们两个
感觉很糟糕。

03:23.286 --> 03:25.538
Patrick: You never
brought  me  flowers.
帕特里克：你从来没有
给我带来了花。

03:25.622 --> 03:27.540
Patrick, go home
and check your mailbox.
帕特里克，回家吧
并检查您的邮箱。

03:27.624 --> 03:28.917
Really?
真的吗？

03:30.043 --> 03:32.462
The Merma-Phone.
Merma 电话。

03:32.545 --> 03:34.464
Mermaid Man here.
人鱼男在这里

03:36.215 --> 03:37.717
Mermaid Man here.
人鱼男在这里

03:37.800 --> 03:41.262
Ah, Commissioner,
what can I do for you?
啊，专员，
我能为你做什么？

03:43.973 --> 03:46.142
You can count on
Mermaid Man, commissioner.
您可以信赖
人鱼男，专员。

03:46.225 --> 03:47.644
It's for you.
这是给你的。

03:47.727 --> 03:49.520
Barnacle Boy here.
藤壶男孩在这里。

03:51.522 --> 03:52.690
Yes, but...
是的，但是……

03:54.525 --> 03:57.111
Yes, yes, Commissioner,
but, uh...
是的，是的，专员，
但是，呃...

03:58.696 --> 04:00.698
The police commissioner
needs us to be
警察局长
需要我们成为

04:00.782 --> 04:03.701
celebrity contestants
at the Bikini Bottom
shuffleboarding competition.
名人参赛者
在比基尼底部
沙狐球比赛。

04:03.785 --> 04:06.621
But there's no way we can do it
in this condition.
但我们没有办法做到这一点
在这种情况下。

04:06.704 --> 04:08.414
What kind of
quitter talk is that?
什么样的
放弃者的谈话是这样的吗？

04:08.498 --> 04:10.833
We're superheroes.
我们是超级英雄。

04:10.917 --> 04:13.252
We're going to that
shuffleboarding competition
我们要去那个
沙狐球比赛

04:13.336 --> 04:15.088
or my name isn't...
或者我的名字不是...

04:16.172 --> 04:17.257
Ow!
噢！

04:17.340 --> 04:19.175
You're right, Barnacle Boy.
你是对的，藤壶男孩。

04:19.258 --> 04:21.970
If only there were someone
to take our place.
如果有人
取代我们的位置。

04:23.721 --> 04:25.139
Patrick and I could do it,
Mermaid Man!
帕特里克和我可以做到，
人鱼男！

04:25.223 --> 04:26.516
What?
什么？

04:26.599 --> 04:27.976
Why should we
trust you two?
我们为什么要
相信你们两个吗？

04:28.059 --> 04:29.602
Because we're
card-carrying members
因为我们是
持卡会员

04:29.686 --> 04:31.479
of the Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy fan club.
人鱼男的
和藤壶男孩粉丝俱乐部。

04:31.562 --> 04:32.939
So?
所以？

04:33.022 --> 04:34.941
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
impersonators.
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩
模仿者。

04:35.024 --> 04:36.567
Certified.
已认证。

04:36.651 --> 04:39.404
You can't argue
with certification.
你不能争论
有认证。

04:39.487 --> 04:41.948
Oh, all right.
哦，好吧。

04:42.031 --> 04:44.242
I suppose they can't do
too much damage.
我想他们做不到
伤害太大。

04:44.325 --> 04:46.661
It's just shuffleboard-
这只是沙狐球——

04:48.204 --> 04:49.455
: We're
gonna be heroes.
: 我们是
会成为英雄。

04:49.539 --> 04:51.499
We're gonna be heroes.
我们会成为英雄。

04:51.582 --> 04:52.667
Would you
cut it out?
你愿意吗
剪掉它吗？

04:52.750 --> 04:53.793
Would you cut it out?
你会把它剪掉吗？

04:53.876 --> 04:56.379
Heroes, heroes, he-roes?
英雄，英雄，男英雄？

04:56.462 --> 04:57.505
Now listen up.
现在听着。

04:57.588 --> 04:58.923
Here, take these rings.
来，拿走这些戒指。

05:00.216 --> 05:01.968
Oh...
哦...

05:02.051 --> 05:03.970
And when you touch 'em together
当你触摸它们的时候

05:04.053 --> 05:06.431
you'll be instantly transformed
into our duplicates.
你会立刻变身
进入我们的副本。

05:08.933 --> 05:11.853
Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy, unite!
人鱼男
和藤壶男孩，团结起来！

05:13.104 --> 05:14.230
We're ready.
我们准备好了。

05:14.313 --> 05:15.231
Man-bob.
曼鲍勃。

05:15.314 --> 05:16.482
And Pat-boy.
还有帕特男孩。

05:16.566 --> 05:18.651
Reporting for duty.
报到值班。

05:18.735 --> 05:20.653
When you're through with
shuffleboarding
当你完成时
沙狐球

05:20.737 --> 05:22.989
you're to bring those costumes
right back here.
你要带上那些服装
就回到这里。

05:23.072 --> 05:25.825
And  don't  do anything else.
并且不要做任何其他事情。

05:25.908 --> 05:27.994
Don't go home first,
don't show your friends
先别回家
不要给你的朋友看

05:28.077 --> 05:30.329
just come right back here,
you got it?
刚回到这里，
你明白了吗？

05:30.413 --> 05:31.456
Got it.
知道了。

05:31.539 --> 05:32.832
This'll never work.
这永远行不通。

05:32.915 --> 05:35.251
What will never work?
什么永远行不通？

05:35.334 --> 05:38.212
Shuffleboarding,
shuffleboarding,
shuffleboarding!
沙狐球、
沙狐球，
沙狐球！

05:40.089 --> 05:42.508
Shuffleboarding is exciting,
huh, Patrick?
沙狐球很刺激，
嗯，帕特里克？

05:42.592 --> 05:44.010
Well, duh.
嗯，呃。

05:44.093 --> 05:46.012
What's your favorite thing
about shuffleboarding?
你最喜欢什么
关于沙狐球？

05:46.095 --> 05:47.263
Everything.
一切。

05:47.346 --> 05:50.516
It's even fun
just to say the word.
还挺好玩的
只是为了说这个词。

05:50.600 --> 05:53.352
: Shuffleboard.
：沙狐球。

05:53.436 --> 05:57.356
Shuffle-el-el-el-board.
洗牌-el-el-el-board。

05:57.440 --> 05:59.025
Ah, it is fun.
啊，很有趣。

05:59.108 --> 06:02.737
We're gonna seriously
kick some elderly buns today.
我们要认真的
今天踢一些老人包子。

06:02.820 --> 06:04.155
Huh, SpongeBob?
哈，海绵宝宝？

06:04.238 --> 06:05.364
What?
什么？

06:05.448 --> 06:07.950
Out of the way, Gramps.
让开，爷爷。

06:08.034 --> 06:10.244
That's my trophy,
old lady.
那是我的奖杯
老太太。

06:11.704 --> 06:13.206
Patrick?
帕特里克？

06:13.289 --> 06:15.249
It's gonna be
an action-packed thrill ride
将会是
充满动感的惊险旅程

06:15.333 --> 06:17.627
of geriatric proportions.
的老年人比例。

06:17.710 --> 06:19.504
And the best part is
最好的部分是

06:19.587 --> 06:22.840
there is  no  way we can lose
with these costumes on.
我们不可能失败
穿上这些服装。

06:22.924 --> 06:24.342
We already won the tournament.
我们已经赢得了比赛。

06:24.425 --> 06:28.054
Oh, yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

06:28.137 --> 06:29.889
Well, how come
I didn't get a trophy?
嗯，怎么会呢
我没拿到奖杯？

06:29.972 --> 06:31.724
You did, it's in
your back pocket.
你做到了，它在
你的后口袋。

06:33.017 --> 06:35.645
Oh, yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

06:35.728 --> 06:37.396
Well, let's go
do something else.
好吧，我们走吧
做点别的事。

06:37.480 --> 06:38.940
Ok.
好的。

06:39.023 --> 06:41.692
You're to bring those costumes
right back here.
你要带上那些服装
就回到这里。

06:41.776 --> 06:45.029
Don't do anything else.
不要做任何其他事情。

06:46.322 --> 06:48.783
Patrick, stop!
帕特里克，停下来！

06:48.866 --> 06:51.119
We can't.
我们不能。

06:51.202 --> 06:52.954
We have to
get the costumes back.
我们必须
把服装拿回来。

06:53.037 --> 06:55.915
For Neptune's sake,
SpongeBob.
为了海王星的缘故，
海绵宝宝。

06:55.998 --> 06:59.085
If  we're  not
gonna go around town
如果我们不是
要去城里转转

06:59.168 --> 07:01.379
pretending to be
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
假装是
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩

07:01.462 --> 07:02.421
then who is?
那么是谁呢？

07:02.505 --> 07:04.048
Uh, nobody?
呃，没人吗？

07:04.132 --> 07:05.424
Exactly.
确切地。

07:05.508 --> 07:08.177
And with no one
patrolling the town
而且没有人的情况下
镇上巡逻

07:08.261 --> 07:10.680
who's gonna stop
those youngsters from loitering?
谁会停下来
那些闲逛的年轻人？

07:12.723 --> 07:14.183
Their mommies?
他们的妈妈？

07:14.267 --> 07:15.768
No, we are.
不，我们是。

07:15.852 --> 07:17.436
Let's take 'em to the slammer.
让我们带他们去监狱吧。

07:17.520 --> 07:21.691
Patrick!
帕特里克！

07:21.774 --> 07:23.067
"Too harsh"?
“太严厉”？

07:25.653 --> 07:27.655
Explain.
解释。

07:27.738 --> 07:30.408
Mermaid man and Barnacle Boy?
美人鱼男和藤壶男孩？

07:30.491 --> 07:32.326
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

07:32.410 --> 07:33.953
Ugh.
啊。

07:38.791 --> 07:40.501
Wasting a Krabby Patty?
浪费蟹黄饼？

07:42.879 --> 07:44.797
How could you?
你怎么可以？

07:44.881 --> 07:46.883
I'm full.
我吃饱了。

07:49.510 --> 07:52.221
Well, maybe somebody
should've thought about that
好吧，也许有人
应该考虑一下

07:52.305 --> 07:54.765
before they ponied up for
the world's greatest patty...
在他们付钱之前
世界上最大的肉饼...

07:54.849 --> 07:56.893
Mr. jail warden.
监狱长先生。

07:59.353 --> 08:02.148
You're right, Pat-boy,
this town needs us.
你说得对，帕特男孩，
这个小镇需要我们。

08:06.402 --> 08:07.528
You're chewing too loud.
你咀嚼的声音太大了。

08:07.612 --> 08:10.406
Ow.
噢。

08:10.489 --> 08:12.200
Your shoe's untied.
你的鞋带解开了。

08:14.911 --> 08:16.412
You're too old.
你太老了。

08:25.796 --> 08:27.632
SpongeBob: Ah, I think
we've done our work, Patrick.
海绵宝宝：啊，我想
我们已经完成了我们的工作，帕特里克。

08:27.715 --> 08:30.509
Now let's return
these costumes.
现在让我们返回
这些服装。

08:35.097 --> 08:36.474
That's the evil Man-Ray.
那是邪恶的曼雷。

08:39.602 --> 08:41.854
What diabolical plan
could he be up to?
什么邪恶的计划
他能做到吗？

08:41.938 --> 08:44.732
Why, hello, Ray.
为什么，你好，雷。

08:44.815 --> 08:47.902
Mabel, I haven't seen you
since high school.
梅布尔，我没见过你
从高中开始。

08:47.985 --> 08:49.654
Look at him, Patrick.
看看他，帕特里克。

08:49.737 --> 08:51.239
Plotting with his evil minion.
与他邪恶的爪牙密谋。

08:51.322 --> 08:54.992
Say, could I borrow
some of your detergent?
说，我可以借吗
你的一些洗涤剂？

08:55.076 --> 08:56.786
Why, certainly.
为什么，当然。

08:56.869 --> 08:58.871
Anything for the gal
I went to the prom with.
为了妹子什么都可以
我和我一起去参加舞会。

08:58.955 --> 09:00.790
I'll be he's handing off
some secret weapon.
我会被他移交
一些秘密武器。

09:00.873 --> 09:01.999
Time to crash this party.
是时候让这个聚会崩溃了。

09:02.083 --> 09:04.961
You haven't aged a day, Ray.
你一天也没变老，雷。

09:05.044 --> 09:07.046
Oh, you.
哦，你。

09:07.129 --> 09:08.422
SpongeBob: Hello, Man-Ray.
海绵宝宝：你好，曼雷。

09:08.506 --> 09:09.966
Who's your friend?
谁是你的朋友？

09:10.049 --> 09:12.218
Hey, Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy.
嘿，人鱼男
和藤壶男孩。

09:12.301 --> 09:14.929
I'd like you to meet Mabel.
我想让你见见梅布尔。

09:15.012 --> 09:17.765
Any friend of Ray's
is a friend of mine.
雷的任何朋友
是我的一个朋友。

09:17.848 --> 09:20.059
All right, Mabel,
that's enough chit-chat.
好吧，梅布尔，
闲聊就够了。

09:20.142 --> 09:22.728
Now are you gonna come quietly
or we will have to take you
to jail by force?
现在你要悄悄地来吗
否则我们就得带你去
强行入狱？

09:22.812 --> 09:25.606
Playing dumb, eh?
装傻吧？

09:25.690 --> 09:27.692
You handle Man-Ray.
你对付曼雷。

09:27.775 --> 09:29.068
I'll take care of his lackey.
我会照顾他的跟班。

09:30.611 --> 09:31.654
Mabel?
梅布尔？

09:31.737 --> 09:32.863
SpongeBob: Hai-yah!
海绵宝宝：哈喽！

09:32.947 --> 09:34.740
Eat dryer sheets, Man-Ray.
吃烘干机床单，曼雷。

09:38.911 --> 09:40.079
It's on now.
现在已经开始了

09:40.162 --> 09:42.581
Filthy shorts attack.
肮脏的短裤袭击。

09:45.042 --> 09:47.253
Clothes basket bombardment.
衣物篮轰炸。

09:53.634 --> 09:56.137
Surrender... Mermaid Man?
投降……人鱼男？

09:56.220 --> 09:58.597
Ow, that's it.
噢，就是这样。

09:58.681 --> 10:01.684
Time for the spin cycle.
旋转周期的时间。

10:07.064 --> 10:10.526
Not so fast, Man-Ray.
没那么快，曼雷。

10:10.609 --> 10:12.278
Wha...?
世界卫生大会...？

10:13.195 --> 10:14.488
You're all wet.
你都湿透了

10:14.572 --> 10:16.449
You need to dry out.
你需要擦干。

10:16.532 --> 10:17.742
What?
什么？

10:17.825 --> 10:21.787
No, my head is dry clean only...
不，我的头只是干洗过的......

10:21.871 --> 10:23.998
: But
I didn't do anything.
：但是
我什么也没做。

10:24.081 --> 10:25.958
Just keep moving.
继续前进。

10:26.042 --> 10:27.418
You too, missy.
你也是，小姐。

10:29.879 --> 10:31.714
Well, our work is done here.
好了，到这里我们的工作就完成了。

10:43.809 --> 10:46.145
Man: My legs, my legs...
男：我的腿，我的腿……

10:46.228 --> 10:47.605
Woman: Dr. Forrest, dial one...
女：福雷斯特博士，请拨一个……

10:47.688 --> 10:49.148
Mermaid Man: Good job, boys.
美人鱼男：干得好，孩子们。

10:49.231 --> 10:52.526
You won the tournament
and returned the costumes.
你赢得了比赛
并归还了服装。

11:00.743 --> 11:02.787
Thanks again, boys.
再次感谢，孩子们。

11:02.870 --> 11:04.705
Just doing our merma-duty.
只是履行我们的人鱼职责。

11:04.789 --> 11:06.832
And then some.
然后是一些。

11:06.916 --> 11:08.584
"And then some,"
that's good.
“然后还有一些，”
那很好。

11:08.668 --> 11:10.336
Good-bye, young men.
再见，年轻人。

11:10.419 --> 11:13.589
Oh, look, we have more visitors.
哦，看，我们有更多的访客。

11:13.673 --> 11:15.257
Woman: There they are,
oh, get 'em.
女：他们在那里，
哦，得到他们。

11:15.341 --> 11:17.551
Looking good, Man-Ray.
看起来不错，曼雷。

11:22.890 --> 11:25.393
Faster, you old coot.
快点，你这个老笨蛋。

11:29.355 --> 11:31.774
They have so many fans.
他们有很多粉丝。

11:50.126 --> 11:52.294
Thank you.
谢谢。

11:52.378 --> 11:53.796
Thank you.
谢谢。

11:56.549 --> 11:57.341
Ah.
啊。

11:57.425 --> 11:59.093
Isn't it grand?
是不是很盛大呢？

11:59.176 --> 12:00.344
What is?
什么是？

12:00.428 --> 12:02.721
He's such a great musician.
