12:08.477 --> 12:10.938
All right, I've had enough.
好吧，我受够了。

12:11.021 --> 12:13.190
Bunch of nonsense.
一堆废话。

12:13.274 --> 12:15.860
Why, here he comes now.
哎呀，他现在来了。

12:15.943 --> 12:18.737
It  is  him.
是他。

12:18.821 --> 12:20.322
Huh?
啊？

12:20.406 --> 12:23.868
Aren't you the esteemed
Squilliam Fancyson the Third
你不是尊贵的吗
斯奎利姆·奇森三世

12:23.951 --> 12:27.288
who we all came here
to see perform tonight?
我们都来这里的人
今晚去看演出吗？

12:27.371 --> 12:28.581
No, I am not.
不，我不是。

12:28.664 --> 12:30.833
Nor would I ever want to be.
我也不想成为这样的人。

12:30.916 --> 12:33.794
I am quite content being
Squidward Q. Tentacles.
我很满足
章鱼哥 Q. 触手。

12:33.878 --> 12:36.088
Oh, dear.
哦亲爱的。

12:36.172 --> 12:37.590
Well, that's too bad.
嗯，那太糟糕了。

12:37.673 --> 12:38.466
