为什么？

12:38.549 --> 12:41.218
Because I'm head matron
因为我是女校长

12:41.302 --> 12:43.846
at an esteemed
musical college in town
在受人尊敬的
镇上的音乐学院

12:43.929 --> 12:47.099
and thought if you  were
Squilliam Fancyson
并想如果你是
斯奎利安·范西森

