15:34.016 --> 15:35.517
Ok, good.
好的，很好。

15:35.601 --> 15:37.269
Hey, he blinked three times.
嘿嘿，他眨了三下眼睛。

15:37.353 --> 15:40.356
Wow, only eight minutes in
哇，只有八分钟

