and we've already
been given a math quiz.
我们已经
进行了数学测验。

15:42.483 --> 15:44.777
Very advanced music class,
huh, Patrick?
非常高级的音乐课，
嗯，帕特里克？

15:44.860 --> 15:46.111
I'll say.
我会说。

15:46.195 --> 15:48.822
Would you two numbskulls
mind telling me
你们两个笨蛋愿意吗
介意告诉我

