帕特里克在这里保留
挠我的脚。

16:53.512 --> 16:56.181
No way, he's making that up.
不可能，他正在弥补。

16:56.265 --> 16:57.725
It was him.
是他。

16:57.808 --> 17:00.602
You expect me to believe
he was tickling himself?
你期望我相信
他在给自己挠痒痒吗？

17:00.686 --> 17:03.063
You better tell him, SpongeBob.
你最好告诉他，海绵宝宝。

17:03.147 --> 17:04.356
All right, it was me.
好吧，是我。

17:04.440 --> 17:06.108
You were tickling yourself.
你在给自己挠痒痒。

17:06.191 --> 17:07.401
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

17:07.484 --> 17:08.610
How?
如何？

17:14.199 --> 17:16.702
All right, that's enough!
好吧，够了！

17:22.541 --> 17:24.084
There.
