20:05.537 --> 20:09.041
the esteemed musical genius
Squilliam Fancyson.
受人尊敬的音乐天才
斯奎利亚姆·凡西森。

20:09.124 --> 20:10.959
SpongeBob And Patrick: Tick,
tick, tick, tick, tick...
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：勾选，
勾勾，勾勾，勾勾，勾勾……

20:11.043 --> 20:12.294
Tick, tick, tick, tick...
