那些学生是你的吗？

20:14.671 --> 20:16.214
Nope, they're just morons.
不，他们只是白痴。

20:16.298 --> 20:18.050
Come on, you two,
snap out of it.
来吧，你们两个，
摆脱它。

20:18.133 --> 20:21.678
They appear to be
in some type of trance.
他们似乎是
处于某种恍惚状态。

20:21.762 --> 20:24.389
A case of genuine
hypnosis like this
正品案例
像这样的催眠

20:24.473 --> 20:26.224
makes a much hotter scoop.
做了一个更热的勺子。

20:26.308 --> 20:28.060
Hotter scoop?
更热的勺子？

20:28.143 --> 20:31.063
Well, it's the sort of thing
that borders on the paranormal.
嗯，就是这样的事情
这接近于超自然现象。

20:31.146 --> 20:32.814
Our viewers just
eat that stuff up.
我们的观众只是
把那些东西吃掉。

20:32.898 --> 20:35.108
Paranormal?
超自然现象？

20:35.192 --> 20:37.945
The only thing paranormal
around here
唯一的超自然现象
在这附近

20:38.028 --> 20:41.281
is how fast I'm gonna
make you two disappear.
我要多快
让你们两个消失。

20:41.365 --> 20:42.908
Don't blame me...
别怪我...

20:42.991 --> 20:44.910
Blame the market...
归咎于市场...

20:47.663 --> 20:49.456
What, where am I?
什么，我在哪儿？

20:49.539 --> 20:51.917
I felt like I was in
some sort of horrible trance.
我感觉我就像在
某种可怕的恍惚状态。

20:52.000 --> 20:54.503
You want to know what happened?
你想知道发生了什么吗？

20:54.586 --> 20:56.129
Ok.
好的。

20:56.213 --> 21:00.259
You once again managed to
single-handedly annihilate
你再一次成功了
单枪匹马歼灭

21:00.342 --> 21:04.262
what might be the one and only
chance I may ever get
什么可能是唯一的
我可能得到的机会

21:04.346 --> 21:08.183
to sow just one tiny seed
of creative hope
只播下一颗微小的种子
充满创造性的希望

21:08.266 --> 21:10.435
into the culturally barren
wasteland
进入文化贫瘠之地
荒地

21:10.519 --> 21:15.107
that each and every one of us
is forced to call home.
我们每一个人
被迫打电话回家。

21:15.190 --> 21:18.527
Actually, I've been
commuting from upstate.
其实我一直
从北部通勤。

21:18.610 --> 21:23.281
Now I don't suppose you two
have anything to say
for yourselves.
现在我不认为你们两个
有话要说
为了你们自己。

21:23.365 --> 21:26.326
Well, I guess if I was
to say one thing
好吧，我想如果我是
说一件事

21:26.410 --> 21:27.744
it would have to be...
一定是……

21:27.828 --> 21:30.789
We're sorry, Squidward.
我们很抱歉，章鱼哥。

21:30.872 --> 21:33.750
Yeah, we're sorry,
Squidward.
是的，我们很抱歉，
章鱼哥。

21:33.834 --> 21:35.419
No-no-no,
shh-shh-shh.
不不不，
嘘-嘘-嘘。

21:35.502 --> 21:38.880
Hey, did those guys
just call you Squidward?
嘿，那些人是吗？
就叫你章鱼哥吧？

21:38.964 --> 21:41.258
No-no-no-no-no,
they said Squilliam.
不不不不不，
他们说斯奎利姆。

21:41.341 --> 21:44.803
Ugh, I knew this guy
was a phony from minute one.
呃，我认识这个人
从第一分钟起就是一个骗子。

21:44.886 --> 21:45.971
I'm getting out of here.
我要离开这里。

21:46.054 --> 21:47.681
Yeah, me too.
是的，我也是。

21:47.764 --> 21:49.307
I'm gonna get my tuition back.
我要把我的学费拿回来

21:49.391 --> 21:50.892
No, wait.
不，等等。

21:53.520 --> 21:54.646
no!
不！

21:54.730 --> 21:56.523
You're not going anywhere.
你哪儿也去不了。

22:02.738 --> 22:05.490
What, what's going on here?
什么，这是怎么回事？

22:05.574 --> 22:08.326
Sorry, Professor,
your little symphony is over.
对不起，教授，
你的小交响曲结束了。

22:08.410 --> 22:10.495
It's true, we're on to
your little ruse.
这是真的，我们正在努力
你的小诡计。

22:10.579 --> 22:12.039
What a hot scoop.
多么热门的一勺。

22:12.122 --> 22:14.666
The real Squilliam,
as we all know
真正的斯奎利姆，
众所周知

22:14.750 --> 22:19.504
has a large, bushy unibrow just
at the base of his forehead.
有一个又大又浓密的一字眉
在他额头的底部。

22:19.588 --> 22:20.797
But...
但...

22:20.881 --> 22:22.507
No unibrow.
没有一字眉。

22:22.591 --> 22:24.968
Squidward Q. Tentacles,
I'm placing you under arrest
章鱼哥Q.触手，
我要逮捕你

22:25.052 --> 22:26.386
for impersonating a genius.
因为冒充天才。

22:32.934 --> 22:35.270
Tick, tick, tick, tick, tick...
滴答、滴答、滴答、滴答、滴答……

滴答、滴答、滴答、滴答、滴答……